@note The frame is fiction: the office, the night, the rain, the interview and every word the Candidate says. The Candidate personifies a role, not any one system, and none of these tests was run on anything. Lines marked ¶ are the post's own sentences, lightly trimmed; papers and benchmarks are named as the post names them.
