# Source: blog/posts/2026-09-23-benchmarks-we-actually-need.md (2026-09-23).
# ¶ numbers count the post's blocks the way @read does: ¶1 title, ¶2 LeCun,
# ¶3 "Metrics exist", ¶4 "## Ideas", ¶5 the six-item list (every item and its
# sub-bullets), ¶6 "## Extra ideas (maybe)", ¶7 the extra list. HTML-commented
# items in the post are not used.
